<h3>Impact</h3>
<ul>
<li>Outbound email delivery delayed for ~35% of corporate traffic</li>
<li>gateway-prod-01/02 picking up overflow (load: 68%/71%)</li>
</ul>

<h3>Runbook</h3>
<p>Follow <b>IR-2026-34 §4.2</b> for SMTP queue backlog:</p>
<ol>
<li>Check upstream pool status: <code>curl -s http://gateway-prod-03.corp.internal:9090/metrics | grep smtp_pool</code></li>
<li>If mail-pool-04 is greylisted: <code>smtpctl pool remove mail-pool-04</code></li>
<li>Flush queue: <code>smtpctl queue flush --rate 500/s</code></li>
<li>Monitor 15 minutes; if backlog &lt; 10min, resolve</li>
</ol>

